WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.970
In 2023, one index scored 179
countries on how fragile they are.

2
00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:09.190
Somalia ranked first.

3
00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:11.690
Yemen and South Sudan came next.

4
00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:16.370
At the other end, in 179th place: Norway.

5
00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:20.170
The index uses 12
indicators, such as security,

6
00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:22.730
public services and refugees.

7
00:00:22.780 --> 00:00:26.190
So what pulls a country apart,
and what holds one together?

8
00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:27.870
Wealth alone?

9
00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:29.050
A strong army?

10
00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:30.750
The border itself?

11
00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:34.590
In this mission, you'll weigh the
forces that can pull a state apart,

12
00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:37.470
and see what it means for a state to fail.

13
00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:40.050
Then you'll weigh the
forces that unite one,

14
00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:44.390
and see how even unity can leave
some people feeling excluded.

15
00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:47.810
Your mission: explain what
pulls a country apart,

16
00:00:47.860 --> 00:00:49.400
and what holds one together.
